  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"237\">🎧 <strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"235\">Jabra Evolve 65 Flex – Draadloze Headset | Nieuw in Doos</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"341\"><strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"252\">💰 Prijs:</strong> <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"264\">€129,99</strong><br data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"267\"><em data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"305\">(Elders €184,99 – bespaar ruim €55!)</em><br data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"308\"><strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"321\">📦 Staat:</strong> Nieuw / Ongeopend</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"654\">De <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"370\">Jabra Evolve 65 Flex</strong> is dé professionele <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"412\">Bluetooth-headset</strong> voor werken, bellen en concentreren — ideaal voor thuis, op kantoor of onderweg.<br data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"496\">Met <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"535\">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong>, <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"557\">helder HD-geluid</strong> en <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"595\">uitstekende microfoonkwaliteit</strong> biedt deze headset een premium ervaring bij elk gesprek.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"705\">💪 <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"705\">Nieuw in doos – direct klaar voor gebruik.</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"739\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"737\">Specificaties:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"810\">🔊 <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"780\">Actieve ruisonderdrukking (ANC)</strong> – blokkeert omgevingsgeluid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"886\">\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"886\">🎤 <strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"853\">2 microfoons met Noise Cancelling</strong> – voor kraakheldere gesprekken</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"922\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"909\">Batterijduur:</strong> tot 32 uur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"969\">🔌 <strong data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"944\">Aansluiting:</strong> Bluetooth + USB-dongle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1037\">🔄 <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"994\">Compatibel met:</strong> PC, laptop, smartphone & Microsoft Teams</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1079\">💻 <strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1054\">Bereik:</strong> tot 30 meter draadloos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1142\">🎒 <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1117\">Flexibel, inklapbaar ontwerp</strong> – ideaal voor onderweg</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1193\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1163\">Oplaadtijd:</strong> ±2 uur (snelladen mogelijk)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1217\">💬 <strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1209\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1247\">🌟 <strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1245\">Voordelen:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1432\">✅ Nieuw & ongebruikt<br data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1271\">✅ Premium geluidskwaliteit met ANC<br data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1308\">✅ Licht, comfortabel en flexibel design<br data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1350\">✅ Compatibel met Teams, Zoom, Skype, enz.<br data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1394\">✅ Mega deal – €129,99 i.p.v. €184,99</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1516\">🎯 <strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1452\">Prijs:</strong> €129,99<br data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1463\">📦 Nieuw in doos<br data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1482\">🚚 Ophalen of verzenden mogelijk</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1659\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1539\">Trefwoorden:</strong> Jabra Evolve 65 Flex, headset, Bluetooth, ANC, noise cancelling, draadloos, zakelijk bellen, Teams, nieuw, aanbieding</p>",
